        "accession_number": "0001171843-26-002768",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To comply with these regulations, we developed a Cybersecurity Manual for all our vessels that was reviewed by IMO’s Maritime Safety Committee in March 2021.We are continuously revising our Cybersecurity policy and procedures, to comply with evolving rules and Cybersecurity regulatory landscape.",
        "start_character": 55365,
        "end_character": 55661
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001171843-26-002768",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001171843-26-002768-ccad5f35749dec47",
        "accession_number": "0001171843-26-002768",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We actively manage the deployment of our fleet between spot market voyage charters and short term time charters, which generally last from several days to several weeks, and medium and long term time charters, which can last up to several years.",
